# 行尾规范（阶段 0.5）
#
# 背景：本仓库此前没有 .gitattributes，而 core.autocrlf=true，导致工作区混用行尾
# （src/**.cs 是 LF、src/**.xaml 与 docs/**.md 是 CRLF），每次 git add 都会把上百个
# 文件整体改写行尾，让功能改动的 diff 失去可审查性。
#
# 规则：
#   · 文本文件统一由 Git 归一化为 LF 存入仓库（text=auto）
#   · Windows 专属的构建/脚本/标记类文件在检出时保持 CRLF，避免工具差异
#   · 图片与压缩包等二进制文件禁止行尾转换
#
# 修改本文件后请勿执行 git add --renormalize：本机存在大量未提交改动，
# 重写索引会掩盖真实改动。新文件按此规则写入即可逐步收敛。

# 默认：自动判定文本，仓库内统一 LF
* text=auto

# ── 源代码：仓库内 LF，Windows 检出用 CRLF（与现有工作区一致）──
*.cs          text eol=crlf
*.csproj      text eol=crlf
*.props       text eol=crlf
*.targets     text eol=crlf
*.sln         text eol=crlf
*.xaml        text eol=crlf
*.resx        text eol=crlf
*.manifest    text eol=crlf
*.iss         text eol=crlf
*.ps1         text eol=crlf
*.psm1        text eol=crlf
*.psd1        text eol=crlf
*.cmd         text eol=crlf
*.bat         text eol=crlf
*.fsx         text eol=crlf

# ── 跨平台与部署资产：强制 LF ──
*.sh          text eol=lf
*.js          text eol=lf
*.cjs         text eol=lf
*.mjs         text eol=lf
*.ts          text eol=lf
*.sql         text eol=lf
*.json        text eol=lf
*.jsonl       text eol=lf
*.yml         text eol=lf
*.yaml        text eol=lf
*.toml        text eol=lf
*.html        text eol=lf
*.css         text eol=lf
*.svg         text eol=lf
*.xml         text eol=lf
*.md          text eol=lf

# ── 二进制：禁止任何转换 ──
*.png         binary
*.jpg         binary
*.jpeg        binary
*.gif         binary
*.ico         binary
*.webp        binary
*.pdf         binary
*.zip         binary
*.gz          binary
*.7z          binary
*.rar         binary
*.exe         binary
*.dll         binary
*.pdb         binary
*.so          binary
*.dylib       binary
*.db          binary
*.sqlite      binary
*.sqlite3     binary
*.dwg         binary
*.dxf         binary
*.bak         binary
*.xlsx        binary
*.ttf         binary
*.otf         binary
*.woff        binary
*.woff2       binary
